    "description": "PlasticEnz is an open-source screening tool that combines custom Hidden Markov Models, DIAMOND alignment, and ProtBERT-embedding machine-learning classifiers to detect plastic-degrading enzymes (plastizymes) in user-provided metagenomic contigs, genomes, or protein sequences, supporting 11 plastic polymers with ML classifiers for PET and PHB.",
